==Strategy==
For this stage bringing toxic-immune units (such as [[Gold Brick Cat (Special Cat)|King Nekokhamen]]) can be quite beneficial along with some anti floating units such as [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]], [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo]], and [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] to get rid of the Mini White Cyclone and Gobble. [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier]] can also help with the One Horn and Ginger Snaches and generally chip the other enemies.

