==Trivia==
*Hopscotch Peak's Japanese name, Ken-Kenpa Mine (ケン・ケンパ峰) is derived from ''kenkenpa'', (けんけんぱ), a Japanese game similar to hopscotch. 峰 ''mine'' means peak.

